[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 4 | `bad` | `data == INT_MIN` (extreme negative) | same as row 3 |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 5 | `good` → `goodB2G` | `data < 0` (e.g. `-1`) | `goodG2B` output (9×`0\n` with `1\n` at index 7) then `ERROR: Array index is out-of-bounds\n` |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    29[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 6 | `good` → `goodB2G` | `data == INT_MIN` | same as row 5 |
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    30[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 7 | `good` → `goodB2G` | `data >= 10` (`10`, `11`, `100`, `INT_MAX`) | `goodG2B` output then `ERROR: Array index is out-of-bounds\n` |
