[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    50[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## UB caveat (row 9)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    51[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    52[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `bad(data)` for `data >= 12` is an out-of-bounds stack write whose effect is
