[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    54[0m:[38;5;10m[49m library's own semantics. Disassembly of the C `.so` (`objdump -d`) shows
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `buffer` at `-0x30(%rbp)` and `i` at `-0x4(%rbp)` inside a `0x40`-byte frame:
