[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    63[0m:[38;5;10m[49m No Rust program can reproduce "corrupt my caller's saved frame pointer" both
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    64[0m:[38;5;10m[49m soundly and portably, so the translation instead backs the 10-element buffer
