[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    68[0m:[38;5;10m[49m only in the region where the C program has no defined behaviour at all
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    69[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`>= 12`). Rows 1–8 and 10–12 are asserted byte-identical; row 9 is tested with
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    70[0m:[38;5;10m[49m a documented, explicitly-recorded expectation rather than an equality assert.
